## Why This Is Asked

Real-world IPC, process isolation, and policy enforcement are needed for privacy-critical features. This question tests ability to design a trusted mediator, enforce per-app access, and handle token rotation without destabilizing apps.

## Key Concepts

- Android isolatedProcess and binder IPC via AIDL
- Clipboard interception and privacy filtering
- Hardware-backed Keystore encryption and per-app keys
- Policy-driven redaction and auditing
- Lifecycle and crash resilience

